.TH "INSPEKT\-PASTE" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-paste \- Paste text instantly into the browser.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]paste\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]] \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Paste text instantly into the browser.
.PP
Pastes text into the currently focused input field, or into a specific
element if \(enselector is provided.
.PP
By default, clears any existing text before pasting.
This is equivalent to `inspekt type' with maximum speed.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\f[I]TEXT\f[R]
required text argument
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-s\f[R], \f[B]\(enselector\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
CSS selector to focus before pasting
.TP
\f[B]\(enclear\f[R]
Clear existing text before pasting (default: true)
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt paste \(dqHello World\(dq
.EE
